round camera feeds."],["UL",{"class":"list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-[#A1A1AA]"},["LI",{},["STRONG",{},"Account Data:"]," Email address, full name, and hashed credentials for authenticated access."],["LI",{},["STRONG",{},"Submitted Content:"]," Suspicious text, URLs, or screenshots you choose to scan or share into the app."],["LI",{},["STRONG",{},"Device Push Token (Optional):"]," Stored only if you explicitly enable Android push notifications."]]],["SECTION",{"class":"cyber-panel p-5 space-y-2 text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed"},["H2",{"class":"font-mono text-sm font-bold uppercase text-white"},"2. Security, Encryption & Sensitive Redaction"],["P",{},"All API traffic is encrypted in transit via HTTPS/TLS (cleartext HTTP is disabled in release builds). On Android, authentication tokens are stored in hardware-backed Android Keystore (",["CODE",{},"EncryptedSharedPreferences"],"), never in plaintext ",["CODE",{},"localStorage"],". Sensitive personal identifiers are redacted before logging or community intelligence export."]],["SECTION",{"class":"cyber-panel p-5 space-y-2 text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed"},["H2",{"class":"font-mono text-sm font-bold uppercase text-white flex items-center gap-2"},["svg",{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"24","height":"24","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","stroke-width":"2","stroke-linecap":"round","stroke-linejoin":"round","class":"lucide lucide-trash2 w-4 h-4 text-[#FF3D70]"},["path",{"d":"M3 6h18"}],["path",{"d":"M19 6v14c0 1-1 2-2 2H7c-1 0-2-1-2-2V6"}],["path",{"d":"M8 6V4c0-1 1-2 2-2h4c1 0 2 1 2 2v2"}],["line",{"x1":"10","x2":"10","y1":"11","y2":"17"}],["line",{"x1":"14","x2":"14","y1":"11","y2":"17"}]],"3. Retention, Export & Deletion Rights"],["P",{},"You may export your personal data, delete individual scan records from History, or permanently delete your account and associated records directly inside the app or via ",["CODE",{},"/api/v1/privacy"]," endpoints."]],["SECTION",{"class